## Required Fix

Before marking this complete, fix the sed -i compatibility issue in `scripts/sw-code-review-test.sh:40`:

```bash
# Change from:
sed -i '' "s|\$TEST_TEMP_DIR|$TEST_TEMP_DIR|g" "$TEST_TEMP_DIR/bin/git"

# To (matching the pattern in sw-pipeline-test.sh):
if sed -i '' "s|\$TEST_TEMP_DIR|$TEST_TEMP_DIR|g" "$TEST_TEMP_DIR/bin/git" 2>/dev/null; then :; else
    sed -i "s|\$TEST_TEMP_DIR|$TEST_TEMP_DIR|g" "$TEST_TEMP_DIR/bin/git"
fi
```

After this fix, `npm test` should pass completely, validating the entire implementation.
